WEBVTT

01:32.820 --> 01:34.990
This is a problem.

01:35.540 --> 01:36.530
What is?

01:36.530 --> 01:38.920
You haven't noticed yet, huh?

01:39.490 --> 01:42.520
I'm glad I called for you 
before we went to class.

01:43.000 --> 01:46.660
Listen, there's an uproar in class right now. 
It's like we poked a beehive.

01:46.660 --> 01:47.330
Why?

01:47.330 --> 01:51.790
This morning, we were seen 
leaving my condo together.

01:52.140 --> 01:53.480
Right, we were.

01:53.480 --> 01:54.790
And...

01:54.790 --> 01:55.920
And...

01:56.270 --> 02:00.890
The whole class has heard about it!

02:00.890 --> 02:02.320
Say what?!

02:02.320 --> 02:09.120
I went after Yuka-chan and Hirota as soon as 
they saw us to try to deal with it, but...

02:09.120 --> 02:11.810
They had already vanished without a trace!

02:12.420 --> 02:15.160
Maybe I got ahead of them at some point.

02:15.160 --> 02:16.450
That must be it!

02:16.450 --> 02:17.690
Morning.

02:17.690 --> 02:20.320
I opened the door to the classroom, 
hoping for the best.

02:21.700 --> 02:23.450
But there...

02:25.510 --> 02:30.960
There, demons were waiting for me,
 their brains filled with terrible thoughts!

02:31.250 --> 02:35.480
I realized it could turn out to be a long day.

02:35.480 --> 02:38.130
But as many of them as there are, 
they're mere humans.

02:38.130 --> 02:41.240
I could easily plow through them.

02:41.240 --> 02:42.890
Or so I thought.

02:42.890 --> 02:45.140
Alas, the moment I got to my seat...

02:42.970 --> 02:45.140
<b>Alas</b>

02:45.980 --> 02:47.520
I was swarmed.

02:50.140 --> 02:54.440
Captured and trampled upon 
in the blink of an eye!

02:55.340 --> 02:59.050
I only barely managed to make it out here.

02:59.050 --> 03:00.510
I was so scared.

03:00.510 --> 03:02.320
I had no idea...

03:02.620 --> 03:05.400
But how did the rumor get around so quickly?

03:05.400 --> 03:07.480
Was someone else watching us?

03:07.480 --> 03:08.450
No...

03:08.450 --> 03:09.660
It's Hirota.

03:09.660 --> 03:11.000
Hirota told everyone?!

03:11.300 --> 03:12.710
No... It's not that he told anyone.

03:16.090 --> 03:17.310
Hirota!

03:16.390 --> 03:19.550
Akkun and Lily-chan 
were doing morning-after stuff...

03:17.310 --> 03:20.130
Come on! Hirota!

03:19.550 --> 03:23.170
Akkun and Lily-chan 
were doing morning-after stuff...

03:20.130 --> 03:22.980
Akkun and Lily-chan 
were doing morning-after stuff...

03:23.170 --> 03:25.430
Akkun and Lily-chan 
were doing morning-after stuff...

03:25.430 --> 03:31.440
<b>Akkun and Lily-chan were doing morning-after stuff...
They came out of the same condo together.</b>

03:25.840 --> 03:28.830
They came out of the same condo together.

03:28.830 --> 03:31.690
They came out of the same condo together.

03:29.370 --> 03:31.410
Hirota!

03:31.690 --> 03:35.980
It was leaking out of Hirota, 
whose hair had thinned from the shock.

03:35.980 --> 03:37.370
Are you sure that wasn't Sensei?

03:37.370 --> 03:38.820
No, it was Hirota!

03:38.820 --> 03:40.500
Tanigawa was calling his name, too!

03:40.500 --> 03:44.160
Either way, we need to do something!

03:44.160 --> 03:46.680
<i>Do you really need to be so bothered?</i>

03:46.680 --> 03:49.970
<i>I don't actually mind that much.</i>

03:49.970 --> 03:52.750
<i>Yeah, and it's not going to affect my work.</i>

03:53.320 --> 03:55.930
You're going out with Amane-san, 
aren't you, Akutsu-kun?

03:55.930 --> 03:58.450
Is it true you're going around 
hitting on girls?

03:58.450 --> 03:59.970
That's so creepy.

03:59.970 --> 04:01.880
<i>Wait, it is!</i>

04:01.880 --> 04:04.930
<i>I'm not going to be able to
talk to any good talent I find!</i>

04:06.670 --> 04:07.770
All right.

04:07.770 --> 04:09.140
I'll help out.

04:11.230 --> 04:15.100
Let's cooperate and dispel the rumor together.

04:16.340 --> 04:17.690
You're freaking out an awful lot.

04:17.690 --> 04:18.450
I'm not!

04:18.450 --> 04:20.170
I'm not freaking out!

04:20.170 --> 04:22.320
Seriously, it's no biggie!

04:22.570 --> 04:25.330
<i>You don't need to panic so much.</i>

04:25.330 --> 04:26.430
<i>Well, fine.</i>

04:26.430 --> 04:28.240
<i>Why don't we show them...</i>

04:29.190 --> 04:31.850
<i>An angel and a demon putting on a little show!</i>

04:34.580 --> 04:36.440
What? No way.

04:36.440 --> 04:37.170
You aren't lying?

04:37.170 --> 04:38.750
I'm serious.

04:38.750 --> 04:40.500
<i>There are even more people now.</i>

04:40.500 --> 04:43.220
<i>And Yuka-chan's joined the fray, too.</i>

04:43.220 --> 04:47.050
<i>I guess I'm not surprised, considering 
she was one of the witnesses.</i>

04:47.050 --> 04:49.050
<i>Damn you...</i>

04:53.530 --> 04:57.100
Anyway, like I said earlier...

04:57.940 --> 04:58.890
<i>Here we go.</i>

04:59.580 --> 05:02.360
Sorry, I'm gonna go buy a drink.

05:03.560 --> 05:05.280
I'll go buy one!

05:05.550 --> 05:07.530
A tactical retreat, maybe?

05:09.020 --> 05:10.490
<i>It isn't.</i>

05:10.810 --> 05:12.010
<i>It's...</i>

05:13.450 --> 05:15.690
<i>A strategic confrontation!</i>

05:19.750 --> 05:20.630
Hmm?!

05:25.250 --> 05:26.820
Oh, sorry.

05:26.820 --> 05:28.650
Hey, my bad.

05:29.180 --> 05:30.810
Are you on your way to school?

05:30.810 --> 05:33.050
I was just taking a shower.

05:33.050 --> 05:35.460
Oh, yeah, were you all right?

05:35.460 --> 05:36.210
Huh?

05:36.210 --> 05:39.020
Oh, yeah, thanks to you.

05:40.230 --> 05:41.640
Great.

05:41.640 --> 05:43.770
Oh, I'm going to go buy a drink.

05:44.780 --> 05:45.820
Sure.

05:45.820 --> 05:47.280
Later!

05:51.930 --> 05:53.700
What was that shameless act?

05:53.700 --> 05:55.320
That was so obvious.

05:55.320 --> 05:56.220
Hold it!

06:00.040 --> 06:01.290
Koyamatsu-san!

06:01.290 --> 06:03.500
It's the manga freak, Koyamatsu-san!

06:04.200 --> 06:06.370
I've analyzed all of it.

06:06.970 --> 06:10.030
That might not have been an act.

06:10.030 --> 06:12.470
Huh? It obviously was.

06:12.820 --> 06:14.430
Didn't any of you notice?

06:14.780 --> 06:17.560
Those two seemed to be 
holding a normal conversation,

06:17.560 --> 06:21.280
but they were properly distanced 
with their personal space.

06:21.280 --> 06:22.530
Personal...?

06:22.530 --> 06:24.330
If they were both acting,

06:24.330 --> 06:26.790
there would've been some
awkwardness to give it away.

06:26.790 --> 06:29.800
They might be too close together 
or too far away...

06:29.800 --> 06:33.770
But those two were definitely maintaining 
a normal distance from each other!

06:33.770 --> 06:37.450
Which means they aren't going steady!

06:37.450 --> 06:38.720
Say what?!

06:38.720 --> 06:42.160
But there's still the possibility 
that it <i>was</i> an act.

06:42.160 --> 06:43.740
Let's observe for a while longer!

06:43.740 --> 06:44.920
Mm-hmm!

06:45.470 --> 06:47.390
<i>You're amazing, Amane...</i>

06:47.390 --> 06:51.220
<i>They fell right for your plan!</i>

06:51.220 --> 06:55.220
Amane

06:51.620 --> 06:55.220
<i>Angels sure are a force to be reckoned with.</i>

06:55.220 --> 06:56.890
Oh, but then again, like....

06:55.390 --> 07:10.110
<b>Oh, but then again, like....</b>

06:56.890 --> 06:59.150
"Akutsu-kun was taking a stroll 
on his way home from school

06:59.150 --> 07:00.430
when he discovered a huge condo,

07:00.430 --> 07:02.800
and his curiosity got the better of him, 
so he went in to explore but got lost,

07:02.800 --> 07:06.020
and fought off enemies 
as he made his way to the exit.

07:06.020 --> 07:07.840
But then he fell for a trap 
and was encased in stone until I,

07:07.840 --> 07:10.110
who happened to live in the condo, 
came to his rescue,"

07:10.110 --> 07:12.870
is what Lily-chan said, 
but do we actually believe her?

07:13.780 --> 07:15.390
<i>Impressive, Amane.</i>

07:15.390 --> 07:16.520
<i>You're terrifying.</i>

07:16.520 --> 07:18.130
<i>Terrifyingly stupid, that is!</i>

07:18.130 --> 07:20.650
<i>You deal with it from here, nyohoho!</i>

07:20.650 --> 07:21.920
Yeah, that was a bit much.

07:21.920 --> 07:24.860
Who gets encased in stone these days, anyway?

07:25.420 --> 07:26.540
Whoops!

07:28.350 --> 07:29.840
Would you look at that!

07:33.340 --> 07:37.170
There was some marble still left on me.

07:37.720 --> 07:40.210
Maybe it was a misunderstanding after all.

07:40.210 --> 07:42.750
He does have marble on him.

07:42.750 --> 07:44.100
<i>Yes!</i>

07:45.550 --> 07:47.180
Morning, Akutsu-kun.

07:47.180 --> 07:49.300
Morning, Tanigawa.

07:51.780 --> 07:54.090
M-Morning.

07:54.090 --> 07:55.450
<i>She wasn't kidding!</i>

07:56.680 --> 08:00.420
So, anyway, Kensaku gradually grew older,

08:00.420 --> 08:03.390
and by the time I looked at him again, 
he looked like Shiromura-sensei.

08:03.390 --> 08:04.670
That was surprising.

08:04.670 --> 08:07.290
I thought it was Sensei, too.

08:07.290 --> 08:08.520
Right?

08:08.520 --> 08:11.410
I'm glad you're back to normal, Kensaku.

08:11.880 --> 08:13.790
Y-Yeah...

08:13.790 --> 08:16.170
<i>What is she doing now?</i>

08:16.900 --> 08:20.520
Come on, let's go eat together.

08:20.520 --> 08:22.990
<i>She said that threateningly.</i>

08:22.990 --> 08:25.330
<i>Stay on your guard, all right?</i>

08:25.330 --> 08:27.430
<i>Hey, look at me, fool!</i>

08:28.030 --> 08:29.870
Speaking of which, Lily-chan...

08:31.070 --> 08:33.000
Sorry about earlier.

08:33.000 --> 08:34.570
I couldn't help but be curious.

08:34.570 --> 08:37.280
Nah, it's totally fine.

08:37.280 --> 08:38.360
Really?

08:38.360 --> 08:39.580
Then, by way of apology...

08:40.070 --> 08:41.950
Here, say "Ah."

08:42.840 --> 08:44.010
Come on.

08:47.700 --> 08:48.690
Is it good?

08:48.690 --> 08:49.600
Hmm?

08:49.600 --> 08:50.670
Sure, thanks.

08:50.670 --> 08:53.660
Man, what a beautiful sight.

08:53.140 --> 08:53.660
Huh?

08:53.660 --> 08:54.690
Hmm?

08:54.690 --> 08:56.690
What are you looking at, Akutsu-kun?

08:56.690 --> 08:57.640
Are you envious?

08:58.210 --> 08:59.260
<i>That's what you're after!</i>

08:59.660 --> 09:01.140
<i>Which means her next move...</i>

09:01.780 --> 09:04.390
Akutsu-kun says he wants to be fed.

09:04.390 --> 09:06.740
You should do it, Lily-chan.

09:06.740 --> 09:08.560
Hm-hm.

09:08.560 --> 09:10.660
<i>That's her next move.</i>

09:10.660 --> 09:14.440
<i>But I'm sure Akutsu expects that much.</i>

09:14.440 --> 09:15.540
<i>It won't be an issue.</i>

09:15.540 --> 09:17.070
Oh, all right.

09:17.070 --> 09:19.070
Here, say "Ah."

09:22.330 --> 09:23.330
<i>What...</i>

09:23.330 --> 09:24.330
<i>...is that?!</i>

09:25.570 --> 09:26.540
<i>Well?</i>

09:26.540 --> 09:28.480
<i>You didn't expect that, did you?</i>

09:28.480 --> 09:30.040
<i>It's really embarrassing, though.</i>

09:30.470 --> 09:31.610
Let's see...

09:31.610 --> 09:33.630
According to my database...

09:33.630 --> 09:34.970
It's jealousy.

09:34.970 --> 09:38.110
Get close with one of the two, 
and make the other jealous.

09:38.110 --> 09:40.970
That's the easiest way 
to get to the bottom of it.

09:40.970 --> 09:42.920
You're awesome, Koyamatsu-san!

09:42.920 --> 09:44.440
Let's go with that!

09:45.220 --> 09:46.850
It's no big deal.

09:46.850 --> 09:50.290
<i>And I can make Kensaku jealous 
at the same time, too.</i>

09:50.290 --> 09:52.480
Oh, come on. Don't be shy.

09:52.480 --> 09:55.160
We're friends, aren't we? This is normal.

09:55.160 --> 09:57.110
R-Right...

09:57.110 --> 09:59.900
<i>And I set it up ahead of time 
so there are no misunderstandings.</i>

09:59.900 --> 10:02.490
<i>Well? Lily-chan?</i>

10:07.420 --> 10:09.410
<i>She's reacting really obviously!</i>

10:09.410 --> 10:10.750
<i>I never knew she could make that face!</i>

10:15.590 --> 10:17.140
<i>He didn't hesitate at all.</i>

10:17.140 --> 10:18.280
Let's see...

10:18.780 --> 10:20.870
Lily-chan, do you wanna be fed, too?

10:22.390 --> 10:24.770
<i>O-Oh shit, I pissed her off!</i>

10:25.640 --> 10:26.770
No way.

10:26.770 --> 10:28.460
That's embarrassing.

10:28.460 --> 10:31.150
<i>That smile is seriously scaring me.</i>

10:32.840 --> 10:33.810
How was it?

10:33.810 --> 10:34.490
Hmm?

10:34.490 --> 10:36.190
It was a normal tomato.

10:37.510 --> 10:40.030
<i>I don't think they're going out or anything.</i>

10:40.030 --> 10:42.520
<i>He would have hesitated more.</i>

10:42.520 --> 10:46.410
<i>And if they were trying to hide it, 
they would be making eye contact or something.</i>

10:46.410 --> 10:48.030
<i>Neither of those things is true,</i>

10:48.030 --> 10:51.630
<i>which means there was some other reason 
they were coming out together.</i>

10:51.970 --> 10:53.570
<i>But...</i>

10:57.150 --> 10:59.500
<i>Why am I so irritated?</i>

10:59.500 --> 11:00.260
<i>Of course...</i>

11:00.550 --> 11:03.010
<i>It must be because I had 
to look at his goofy face.</i>

11:03.450 --> 11:06.390
<i>What an awful thing to see during my meal.</i>

11:06.390 --> 11:08.330
<i>This is sexual harassment!</i>

11:09.160 --> 11:11.550
<i>There's definitely something going on.</i>

11:11.550 --> 11:12.530
<i>All right...</i>

11:12.530 --> 11:14.820
<i>I'm going to give them a nudge.</i>

11:14.820 --> 11:16.490
So, Akutsu-kun...

11:16.490 --> 11:18.290
Are you free this weekend?

11:18.290 --> 11:19.950
Yeah, for now.

11:20.390 --> 11:21.530
In that case...

11:21.530 --> 11:25.870
Wanna go somewhere together next weekend?

11:30.920 --> 11:32.070
Well?

11:32.580 --> 11:33.720
Do I look good?

11:34.040 --> 11:35.720
Y-Yeah.

11:35.720 --> 11:37.140
That looks pretty good.

11:37.140 --> 11:39.140
Are you just saying that?

11:39.140 --> 11:40.720
Of course not.

11:41.190 --> 11:42.780
<i>What was she expecting?</i>

11:42.780 --> 11:45.160
<i>I said okay so she wouldn't be suspicious...</i>

11:45.160 --> 11:47.630
<i>But there has to be a reason 
she asked to hang out out.</i>

11:47.630 --> 11:48.970
What's wrong?

11:48.970 --> 11:50.980
You don't have to be so nervous.

11:50.980 --> 11:53.730
I just wanted to hang out with you.

11:53.730 --> 11:56.770
I'm not scheming anything. Okay?

11:57.730 --> 11:59.360
You're right.

11:59.360 --> 12:01.650
<i>I don't have to go demon hunting on weekends.</i>

12:01.650 --> 12:02.910
<i>I guess I should have fun.</i>

12:02.910 --> 12:05.000
Actually, those glasses are pretty nice.

12:05.000 --> 12:05.980
Nice glasses.

12:05.980 --> 12:07.060
Really?

12:07.060 --> 12:08.500
Maybe I'll buy them, then.

12:08.500 --> 12:09.720
Do it!

12:09.720 --> 12:11.000
Yay!

12:22.300 --> 12:23.440
<i>Damn you, Akutsu!</i>

12:23.440 --> 12:25.150
<i>What's with that giddy face?</i>

12:25.150 --> 12:28.910
<i>Don't you get that Yuka-chan 
is suspicious of the two of us?</i>

12:29.350 --> 12:34.810
<i>I need to keep an eye on him so that I can 
stop him when he's about to say anything off!</i>

12:34.810 --> 12:36.440
<i>I'm not peeping.</i>

12:36.440 --> 12:37.530
<i>This is a mission.</i>

12:37.530 --> 12:40.810
Yeah, this is definitely interesting.

12:40.810 --> 12:43.560
I didn't think you would invite me, though.

12:43.560 --> 12:45.070
N-No?

12:45.370 --> 12:47.400
Maybe we should tag along.

12:45.370 --> 12:51.580
<b>Maybe
we
should 
tag 
along.</b>

12:47.320 --> 12:51.580
<b>In secret.</b>

12:47.400 --> 12:48.220
In secret.

12:48.200 --> 12:53.830
<b>Oh, not to peep or anything,
but because
Yuka-chan's
my friend.</b>

12:48.220 --> 12:52.020
Oh, not to peep or anything, 
but because Yuka-chan's my friend.

12:52.020 --> 12:53.720
I didn't think you'd
be interested in this.

12:53.720 --> 12:56.270
I-I can't help but be curious!

12:56.270 --> 12:57.250
Yeah?

12:57.250 --> 12:58.970
Thanks for inviting me, though.

12:59.460 --> 13:01.250
Hirota's losing it, too.

13:01.250 --> 13:04.000
I'm finally on a date with Lily-chan!

13:04.000 --> 13:04.980
<i>Hirota!</i>

13:04.980 --> 13:07.630
<i>You're just insurance in case 
we get caught following them.</i>

13:07.630 --> 13:08.970
<i>This is definitely not a date!</i>

13:08.970 --> 13:12.570
Lily-chan came to check up on Akutsu-kun.

13:12.570 --> 13:15.310
You have feelings for me?!

13:15.650 --> 13:17.920
With you here, I can make up 
some kind of cover story.

13:17.920 --> 13:21.010
Further, with Tanigawa here 
as an optional member,

13:21.010 --> 13:23.440
they won't think I'm on a date with Hirota.

13:23.440 --> 13:24.980
Hello. I'm optional.

13:23.440 --> 13:26.280
<b>Hello.</b>

13:24.070 --> 13:26.280
<b>I'm optional.</b>

13:26.680 --> 13:29.090
I'm surprised about Yuka-chan, though.

13:29.090 --> 13:31.310
I thought she was all about Hirota.

13:31.310 --> 13:33.790
Akutsu-kun looks like 
he's having fun, too.

13:34.120 --> 13:34.960
<b>fun, too</b>

13:36.090 --> 13:37.160
What's up?

13:37.160 --> 13:39.730
Oh, it's nothing.

13:40.600 --> 13:41.460
Yeah?

13:41.460 --> 13:43.550
Things are looking nice 
over there, though, huh?

13:43.550 --> 13:45.690
They practically look like 
a couple from this distance.

13:49.090 --> 13:49.950
<i>I see.</i>

13:49.950 --> 13:52.560
<i>Yuka-chan's trying to give Amane-chan a jolt.</i>

13:54.690 --> 13:56.560
They're so lovey-dovey, huh?

13:57.160 --> 13:58.940
<i>Not bad.</i>

13:57.270 --> 13:58.940
<b>Not bad.</b>

13:58.940 --> 14:01.720
Y-Yeah, they are...

14:03.150 --> 14:04.560
Looks like they're moving.

14:04.560 --> 14:05.570
Amane-san, hurry.

14:05.570 --> 14:06.890
R-Right.

14:24.300 --> 14:26.540
Amane-san, they went that way.

14:26.540 --> 14:27.340
Right.

14:31.550 --> 14:33.220
<i>What is this?</i>

14:33.610 --> 14:37.080
<i>Watching them makes my chest sting.</i>

14:38.150 --> 14:42.970
<i>I came to keep an eye on them, 
but now I don't want to see it.</i>

14:45.470 --> 14:46.650
Hey, Amane-san.

14:46.650 --> 14:50.570
If you're going to be so down, 
maybe you could try being more honest.

14:51.110 --> 14:52.810
Wh-What about?

14:52.810 --> 14:54.520
You, too, Hirota.

14:54.520 --> 14:55.150
Huh?

14:55.150 --> 14:57.410
I-I dunno what you're talking about.

14:57.410 --> 14:58.510
Are you sure?

14:58.510 --> 15:00.580
It's all right, then.

15:00.580 --> 15:02.970
Anyway, I have plans later.

15:03.570 --> 15:04.860
Good luck.

15:05.170 --> 15:06.350
Right...

15:06.400 --> 15:08.180
Hey, Hirota-kun, was that...

15:08.180 --> 15:10.210
Oh, I'm going to the washroom for a bit.

15:10.210 --> 15:11.330
Might be a while.

15:13.350 --> 15:16.180
<b>All alone...</b>

15:21.770 --> 15:24.410
<i>Maybe I should go home.</i>

15:24.410 --> 15:27.890
<i>Why did Tanigawa say that, though?</i>

15:27.890 --> 15:29.820
<i>Also, this ache in my chest...</i>

15:30.200 --> 15:34.400
<i>W-Wait, is Tanigawa trying to suggest 
I'm jealous or something?</i>

15:36.410 --> 15:37.540
<i>That's impossible!</i>

15:38.120 --> 15:41.530
<i>I already determined after </i>that<i> 
incident that those feelings</i>

15:41.530 --> 15:43.500
<i>were a misunderstanding.</i>

15:43.500 --> 15:44.730
<i>In my inner meeting.</i>

15:45.340 --> 15:47.090
<i>But...</i>

15:47.390 --> 15:48.630
<i>But...</i>

15:49.920 --> 15:52.970
<i>If that's really true...</i>

15:54.570 --> 15:57.090
<i>I-I...</i>

15:59.060 --> 16:01.570
Akutsu-kun, over here!

16:01.570 --> 16:02.810
Hold up.

16:03.310 --> 16:04.570
Let's sit down.

16:04.570 --> 16:05.940
I'm tired.

16:05.940 --> 16:08.480
<i>Ack! This is bad!</i>

16:08.480 --> 16:10.410
<i>I can't bump into them now!</i>

16:11.690 --> 16:13.630
Hey, there's an open seat there.

16:13.630 --> 16:15.070
Ooh, lucky.

16:16.950 --> 16:19.200
It must be good luck for having been 
on good behavior.

16:19.200 --> 16:20.980
Nah, no way.

16:21.770 --> 16:26.600
<i>I can't believe there's water here.</i>

16:28.190 --> 16:32.340
<i>But if I move now, there's a really 
high chance they'll notice me.</i>

16:33.450 --> 16:37.200
<i>It's really cold, but I don't have 
any choice but to bear it.</i>

16:37.200 --> 16:40.180
Anyway, I've been wanting to ask...

16:40.440 --> 16:42.900
What's really going on
between you and Lily-chan?

16:42.900 --> 16:44.510
So it <i>is</i> about that.

16:44.510 --> 16:45.560
You knew?

16:45.560 --> 16:47.600
<i>S-Stop it!</i>

16:47.600 --> 16:50.930
<i>Don't talk about that stuff now!</i>

16:50.930 --> 16:52.140
Of course I knew.

16:52.140 --> 16:53.480
I guess.

16:53.480 --> 16:55.090
You did say she's cute.

16:55.090 --> 16:56.160
Ah...

16:56.160 --> 16:57.160
Yeah, well...

16:58.060 --> 17:00.720
I guess I do think she's cute.

17:01.700 --> 17:03.260
You said it!

17:03.260 --> 17:05.260
I'm just speaking objectively!

17:05.260 --> 17:07.070
Akutsu-kun's getting shy!

17:07.070 --> 17:08.290
I'm not!

17:08.290 --> 17:09.890
What else? What else?

17:09.890 --> 17:11.000
What do you mean, what else?

17:11.000 --> 17:13.060
<i>What am I grinning about?!</i>

17:13.060 --> 17:15.050
<i>Cool your head!</i>

17:15.970 --> 17:18.540
What do you find attractive about Lily-chan?

17:18.540 --> 17:19.890
What do you like about her?

17:20.980 --> 17:22.560
What do I like about her?

17:25.490 --> 17:29.070
<i>She may be an enemy, but I should be 
honest about her positives.</i>

17:29.070 --> 17:33.220
<i>Someone said something about that 
eventually leading to my own growth, too.</i>

17:33.220 --> 17:34.240
Let's see...

17:35.530 --> 17:37.940
She's got a strong spine.

17:37.940 --> 17:42.820
She has a goal in mind, and she 
works hard toward that goal.

17:42.820 --> 17:45.330
<i>You could also say she doesn't care 
about how she gets things done.</i>

17:45.600 --> 17:46.660
Also...

17:47.150 --> 17:48.920
She's kind, I guess.

17:48.920 --> 17:50.190
<i>For an angel.</i>

17:50.190 --> 17:51.130
Huh.

17:51.650 --> 17:54.630
"She's kind" is pretty obvious,

17:54.630 --> 17:57.190
but those others are 
very keen observations!

17:57.190 --> 17:59.180
I-It's all obvious!

17:59.690 --> 18:03.250
A-Anyone could figure out as much!

18:03.250 --> 18:06.680
I think you do watch her a lot, though.

18:05.720 --> 18:07.470
I do not!

18:08.110 --> 18:10.430
<i>I was just about to drown.</i>

18:10.430 --> 18:12.000
<i>What is this torture?!</i>

18:12.000 --> 18:13.420
<i>Death by compliment?!</i>

18:13.420 --> 18:14.830
Then, then...

18:14.830 --> 18:15.820
<i>There's more?!</i>

18:15.820 --> 18:20.810
Do you ever wish you could go out with her?

18:20.810 --> 18:22.050
What brings that up?

18:22.050 --> 18:24.700
I feel like you've got a thing going.

18:25.550 --> 18:27.410
Well? Well?

18:29.910 --> 18:31.740
<i>A thing, huh?</i>

18:33.220 --> 18:34.590
Well...

18:37.220 --> 18:40.320
I don't think the two of us 
will end up that way.

18:40.320 --> 18:45.610
It's hard to explain, but I have 
some goals of my own.

18:47.790 --> 18:49.510
I don't think it could ever happen.

18:55.780 --> 18:57.930
Is that so?

18:57.930 --> 18:58.810
Yeah.

18:59.820 --> 19:01.280
<i>I mean, of course.</i>

19:01.620 --> 19:04.610
<i>No matter how we feel about each other, 
Amane and I are enemies.</i>

19:04.610 --> 19:05.740
<i>It's impossible.</i>

19:06.180 --> 19:09.020
<i>Besides, making her fall is my goal anyway.</i>

19:09.020 --> 19:10.000
Seriously.

19:11.220 --> 19:13.090
That's so weird.

19:13.090 --> 19:16.550
My gut tells me you definitely have...

19:16.880 --> 19:17.780
What was that?

19:17.780 --> 19:18.650
Dunno.

19:18.650 --> 19:19.540
Koi?

19:19.540 --> 19:21.510
Huh, isn't that Hirota?

19:21.510 --> 19:22.900
Oh, you're right.

19:22.900 --> 19:24.360
What's he up to?

19:24.360 --> 19:25.640
Hey!

19:26.050 --> 19:27.320
H-Huh?

19:27.320 --> 19:28.850
Akkun and Yuka-chan.

19:29.330 --> 19:30.520
What are you two up to?

19:30.520 --> 19:32.560
What about you?

19:32.560 --> 19:35.280
Huh? I'm, er...

19:35.280 --> 19:37.530
Also, who is that for?

19:37.530 --> 19:40.600
This is for Lily-cha— er...

19:41.010 --> 19:41.950
Tanigawa?

19:41.950 --> 19:43.450
Oh, yeah?

19:43.450 --> 19:48.040
You've been going behind my back 
and messing with Lily-chan, huh?

19:48.040 --> 19:49.930
Ow, ow!

19:49.930 --> 19:52.120
Tanigawa was with us until just now, too!

19:51.670 --> 19:53.670
Shut it.

19:52.120 --> 19:53.670
I'm getting stretched out!

19:54.150 --> 19:57.050
<i>He was with Amane?</i>

19:57.050 --> 19:58.040
<i>Here?</i>

19:59.780 --> 20:01.470
Well, Akutsu-kun...

20:01.470 --> 20:03.470
We're leaving now.

20:03.470 --> 20:04.840
Thanks for everything today!

20:04.840 --> 20:06.130
I got stretched out...

20:06.130 --> 20:07.390
I got stretched out!

20:07.390 --> 20:09.410
Okay, take care!

20:09.410 --> 20:10.560
We're leaving, Kensaku!

20:10.560 --> 20:11.890
Akkun, help me!

20:11.890 --> 20:13.400
Akkun!

20:11.890 --> 20:13.660
Don't take it too far.

20:13.660 --> 20:16.650
I got stretched out! 
My head got stretched out!

20:15.270 --> 20:16.650
<i>I should go, too.</i>

20:18.780 --> 20:20.270
<i>It couldn't be. Could it?</i>

20:25.860 --> 20:28.110
So, how was it?

20:29.000 --> 20:29.990
How was what?

20:30.500 --> 20:32.590
You hung out with Lily-chan, didn't you?

20:32.590 --> 20:34.330
Oh, hmm...

20:34.330 --> 20:36.880
It was okay, I guess.

20:41.310 --> 20:42.230
Yeah?

20:50.760 --> 20:56.170
I took a long bath, but it seems like 
I lost a lot of body heat.

20:56.170 --> 20:57.940
I should sleep early.

20:57.940 --> 20:59.440
I'm tired today.

20:59.700 --> 21:01.260
I don't think it could ever happen.

21:02.570 --> 21:03.880
Of course not.

21:04.380 --> 21:06.680
The two of us are enemies, after all.

23:12.500 --> 23:13.500
Morning!

23:13.500 --> 23:14.370
Morning!

23:14.660 --> 23:16.700
I heard Amane-san's taking the day off.

23:16.700 --> 23:17.840
They say it's a cold.

23:17.840 --> 23:18.790
I hope she's okay.

23:18.790 --> 23:20.770
Should we go visit her?

23:20.770 --> 23:22.210
Yeah, maybe.

23:23.900 --> 23:26.670
<i>I never thought she'd get sick.</i>

23:26.670 --> 23:28.080
<i>It's so nice and peaceful.</i>

23:28.080 --> 23:28.920
Who's that?

23:28.920 --> 23:29.590
Dunno.

23:30.250 --> 23:31.630
Her hair's so nice.
